@startuml AIC_Dual_Call_Sequence
title 主回合：生成 → 评价 → 结算

hide footbox
autonumber "<b>00</b>"
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 20
skinparam titleFontSize 22
skinparam CaptionFontSize 14
skinparam sequenceArrowColor #475569
skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam sequenceArrowFontSize 20
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #64748B
skinparam sequenceParticipantFontColor #172B4D
skinparam sequenceGroupBorderColor #CBD5E1
skinparam sequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam sequenceGroupHeaderFontSize 16
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam BoxPadding 12
skinparam Padding 12

participant "客户端" as Client #F0F5FB
participant "回合编排" as Chat #EAF1FB
participant "剧情 LLM" as Story #EBF5F3
participant "裁判 LLM" as Judge #F1EFF9

Client -> Client : 记录本句\n消耗 1 次机会
Client -> Chat : /api/chat\n本句＋历史\n＋当前状态
activate Chat

group ① 剧情生成
  Chat -> Story : 角色提示词\n完整历史\n＋本句
  activate Story
  Story --> Chat : 角色对白
  deactivate Story
  Chat -> Chat : 清洗对白\n机制标签
end

group ② 独立评价
  Chat -> Judge : 裁判提示词\n本句＋对白＋状态\n最近 4 条历史
  activate Judge
  Judge --> Chat : 评价 JSON\n情绪／姿态\n信任／压力／结局
  deactivate Judge
end

group ③ 程序校验与结算
  Chat -> Chat : 字段归一化\n校验门槛
  Chat --> Client : 对白＋评价
  deactivate Chat
  Client -> Client : 先扣损耗\n再加信任\n更新状态\n结局与耗尽兜底
end

caption 剧情生成、语义评价与程序校验各自独立。
@enduml

